From: Chiel Prins <chiel@cpeb.it>
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: rv1109-cs317: set model to AAWireless 1

The board reports itself as the Radxa reference design it derives from,
which is what shows up in /proc/device-tree/model and anywhere userspace
reads the device tree model. Name it for the product instead.

Signed-off-by: Chiel Prins <chiel@cpeb.it>
---
--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/rv1109-cs317.dts	2026-09-18 19:47:04.387292984 +0200
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/rv1109-cs317.dts	2026-09-18 19:51:39.001282379 +0200
@@ -7,7 +7,7 @@
 #include <dt-bindings/input/input.h>
 
 / {
-	model = "Radxa CS317 Board";
+	model = "AAWireless 1";
 	compatible = "rockchip,rv1109-CS317", "rockchip,rv1126";
 
 	dummy_codec: dummy-codec {
